{"id":"f84d91e84ff5873a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-bounded-limit.md","title":"有界变更与wtt停机归约","display":"thm-bounded-limit — 有界变更与wtt停机归约","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-bounded-limit","aliases":["43-thm-bounded-limit"],"display":"thm-bounded-limit — 有界变更与wtt停机归约","depends_on":["[[43-df-wtt]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-computable-approximation]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Corollary 5.6.3, print pp.18–19 / PDF pp.38–39","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-bounded-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-bounded-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bounded-limit — 有界变更与wtt停机归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"01ea56c49b64bbfd\" href=\"?note=01ea56c49b64bbfd\" title=\"43-df-wtt\">43-df-wtt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e87d656c032390a9\" href=\"?note=e87d656c032390a9\" title=\"43-df-computable-approximation\">43-df-computable-approximation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 5.6.3, print pp.18–19 / PDF pp.38–39"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>全定义。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"01ea56c49b64bbfd\" href=\"?note=01ea56c49b64bbfd\" title=\"43-df-wtt\">43-df-wtt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e87d656c032390a9\" href=\"?note=e87d656c032390a9\" title=\"43-df-computable-approximation\">43-df-computable-approximation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\rm wtt}\\varnothing\\prime\\leftrightarrow\\exists g,b\\ (\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:g(x,s+1)\\ne g(x,s)\\}|\\le b(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_{\\rm wtt}\\varnothing\\prime\\leftrightarrow\\exists g,b\\ (\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:g(x,s+1)\\ne g(x,s)\\}|\\le b(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有界使用量的停机集近似仅容许可计算地有界次变更；反向用有限多个“至少变更k次”停机问题决定最终值，查询数量和编码均有输入相关可计算界。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 5.6.3, print pp.18–19 / PDF pp.38–39。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-wtt","status":"resolved","id":"01ea56c49b64bbfd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-wtt]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"e87d656c032390a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-wtt","status":"resolved","id":"01ea56c49b64bbfd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-wtt]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-computable-approximation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-wtt]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-computable-approximation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"e87d656c032390a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-wtt]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-computable-approximation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-wtt]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-computable-approximation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_{\\rm wtt}\\varnothing\\prime\\leftrightarrow\\exists g,b\\ (\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:g(x,s+1)\\ne g(x,s)\\}|\\le b(x)).","display":true}],"bytes":1389,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-bounded-limit]] — 有界变更与wtt停机归约"}],"outgoing":["01ea56c49b64bbfd","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","e87d656c032390a9","f357216a7edb035a"]}